      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "Express-mode apiKeyProvider evaluated per request with nonempty validation and abort boundary; preserve forced x-goog-api-key precedence. Forward Google video metadata using Vertex-specific namespace priority. Explicit hosted Anthropic native/strict defaults false while safe Sonnet5.5/Opus5.5/Fable5.1 schemas use shared forced-tool-incompatible override; Haiku retains JSON tool fallback. Native hosted MaaS/xAI/Anthropic bearer callback uses shared per-request credential resolution. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/google-vertex 5.0.122 to 5.0.129. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
